WEBVTT

00:05:28.538 --> 00:05:30.163
jinhen aap hamesha
se jaanate hain

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:32.621
Yeh kalank hai jo hamaare

00:05:32.621 --> 00:05:34.621
jarvaaje band rakhate hain

00:05:34.621 --> 00:05:37.538
Ham darate hain ki log 
hamen is cheez ke

00:05:37.538 --> 00:05:40.163
bajaay deken ki ham

00:05:40.163 --> 00:05:42.163
vastaav mein kaun hain

00:05:42.163 --> 00:05:44.121
Mujhe pata hai ki mere
saath yeh hua tha

00:05:44.121 --> 00:05:47.288
Lekin mere lie mera naam 
kahana aasaan ho gaya

00:05:47.288 --> 00:05:50.163
Jis tarah se mainne ise 
dekha aur mere sabhee

00:05:50.163 --> 00:05:53.079
sahakarmiyon dvaara 
sveekaar kiya gaya tha

00:05:53.079 --> 00:05:55.871
To jo kuchh bhee tum apanee 
kotharee mein rakh rahe ho

00:05:55.871 --> 00:05:58.329
mujhe ummeed hai ki ye tups
aapakio sashaket karenge

00:05:58.329 --> 00:06:01.163
Aur aape apanee tvacha mein